    "title": "The Past Is the Future: The Science of Fermented Fertilizer",
    "excerpt": "Farmers have rotted plants in barrels for centuries. The lab is finally catching up, and it turns out the bucket was doing real chemistry all along.",
    "author": "Ferment Research",
