    "slug": "how-acidic-ferments-unlock-soil-health",
    "title": "How Acidic Ferments Unlock Soil Health",
    "excerpt": "That sour tang coming off your ferment bucket is the sound of microbes prying nutrients loose from soil that plants couldn't touch on their own.",
    "author": "Ferment Research",
    "date": "2026-07-09",
    "category": "microbiology",
